      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -304
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Drone / rhythm with Pulse\n\n`sound/pulse` is a duty-cycle-controllable square wave. With `width` near 0 it sounds hollow; near ±1 it gets thin. Sweep `width` with sin(time) for a moving timbre.\n\nVisualised by a circle that breathes with the level.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 240
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Drone / rhythm with Pulse\n\n`sound/pulse` is a duty-cycle-controllable square wave. With `width` near 0 it sounds hollow; near ±1 it gets thin. Sweep `width` with sin(time) for a moving timbre.\n\nVisualised by a circle that breathes with the level.",
